An abbreviation definition is recognized only at document level

```
> *[HTML]: Hyper Text

The HTML spec.
.
<blockquote>

</blockquote>
<p>The <abbr title="Hyper Text">HTML</abbr> spec.</p>
```

```
> \*[HTML]: Hyper Text

The HTML spec.
.
<blockquote><p>*[HTML]: Hyper Text</p></blockquote>
<p>The HTML spec.</p>
```
